{"id":"v5quygxwn6mebdp0jmj6dp64o","title":"欧盟委员会上调2026年经济增长预期至1.4%","originalTitle":"欧委会上调今年欧盟经济增长预期至1.4%","summary":"欧盟委员会11月17日发布《2026年秋季经济预测》报告，将今年经济增长预期从1.1%上调至1.4%，同步上调通胀预期至3.3%。报告还预测2027年经济增长1.4%，2028年增速升至1.5%；2027年通胀率预计为3.2%，2028年降至2.3%。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15343247.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:50:39.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T13:22:36.252Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T13:22:36.252Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布","通胀"],"score":86,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a89363c7-cd1d-4d85-a106-68728c35d993","title":"欧盟上调2026经济增长预期至1.4%并补充风险因素"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面快报)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a89363c7-cd1d-4d85-a106-68728c35d993","title":"欧盟上调2026经济增长预期至1.4%并补充风险因素"}],"topics":[{"slug":"inflation","name":"通胀与就业"},{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAReJEPLysSg","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}